<!-- This file limits modules without a lifecycle to functions. -->

# Functional modules

Do not turn these into classes:

- REST functions
- data transformers
- validators
- formatters
- pure utilities

The output must depend only on the input. Do not hide side effects.

```ts
// Good: map a product DTO
function toProduct(dto: ProductDto): Product {
  return { id: dto.id, name: dto.name, slug: dto.slug, price: dto.price };
}

function isInStock(product: Product) {
  return product.price >= 0;
}
```
